{txt}
{com}. 
. * Estimate the share of science-reliant patents using linear fixed effects.
. reghdfe f_cite_science_ratio did, absorb(year firm_id) vce(r)
{res}{txt}(dropped 207157 {browse "http://scorreia.com/research/singletons.pdf":singleton observations})
{res}{txt}({browse "http://scorreia.com/research/hdfe.pdf":MWFE estimator} converged in 8 iterations)
{res}
