{res}{txt}
{com}. est store M2
{txt}
{com}. 
. * ==============================================================================
. * 2. Estimate the CNKI publication-indicator model
. * ==============================================================================
. 
. use ${c -(}RUN5_STATA_CNKI{c )-}CNKI_DID.dta, clear
{txt}
{com}. 
. * Identify firm-years with more than one CNKI publication.
. gen pub_num_dummy = 0
{txt}
{com}. replace pub_num_dummy=1 if pub_num>1
{txt}(93,409 real changes made)

{com}. 
. reghdfe pub_num_dummy did, absorb(year firm_id) vce(r)
{res}{txt}({browse "http://scorreia.com/research/hdfe.pdf":MWFE estimator} converged in 2 iterations)
{res}
{txt}HDFE Linear regression{col 51}Number of obs{col 67}= {res} 2,176,447
{txt}Absorbing 2 HDFE groups{col 51}F({res}   1{txt},{res}2009015{txt}){col 67}= {res}      4.64
